contentText:
TOMORROW X TOGETHER is continuing its mental health chapter. The K-pop group is part of a new global campaign announced by UNICEF&#8217;s Korean Committee during a press conference held Tuesday (April 28). The campaign, titled TOGETHER FOR TOMORROW, is focused on the mental health of kids around the world.

